  <name>Hash-GUI</name>
  <summary>A cross-platform GUI client for Hashcat</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Hash-GUI is a modern, feature-rich graphical user interface for Hashcat —
      the world's fastest and most advanced password recovery utility.
      It supports both Windows and Linux and provides a clean, intuitive workflow
      for managing hash cracking sessions.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Modern UI with real-time progress monitoring</li>
      <li>Live GPU statistics and performance graphs</li>
      <li>Full access to Hashcat attack modes and options</li>
      <li>Integrated terminal with session management</li>
      <li>Multi-language (i18n) support</li>
      <li>Seamless Hashcat and John the Ripper backend integration</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
